{"id": "q0137", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 536156447, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "What is the smallest real number $x$ in the domain of the function $$g(x) = \\sqrt{(x-3)^2-(x-8)^2}~?$$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0137.wav", "input_sha256": "86aad970feea5a3456f1b04e0efa075935d88f2e150a9715bf019ffffeef19fc", "input_samples": 139800, "input_s": 8.738, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.8213, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So we have the function f of x equals the square root of x minus 2 divided by x minus 8 squared. Now, to find the domain of this function, we need to consider two things. First, the expression inside the square root must be non- negative because you can't take the square root of a negative number in the real numbers. Second, the denominator cannot be zero because division by zero is undefined. Let's start with the square root condition. We need x minus 2 greater than or equal to zero. So adding 2 to both sides gives us x greater than or equal to 2.Now, for the denominator, we need x minus 8 squared not equal to zero. Since squaring any real number results in a non-negative value, and it' s only zero when x is exactly 8, we must exclude x equals 8 from the domain. Combining these two conditions, the domain of f is all real numbers x such that x is greater than or equal to 2 but not equal to 8. Therefore, the smallest number in this domain is 2.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 53, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0137_local_local.wav", "sha256": "6cbca82553ba921dc595b9915222c3f3163b6015146d766d55aa74dd3ac1aa3d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 52.64}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.056, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.06, 2.107, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.055, 3.097, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.063, 4.112, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.055, 5.098, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.068, 6.121, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.055, 7.099, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.062, 8.109, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.738, 8.81, 9.209, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.738, 9.801, 10.329, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.738, 10.797, 11.331, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.738, 11.803, 12.476, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.738, 12.796, 13.263, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.738, 13.807, 14.46, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.738, 14.805, 15.451, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.738, 15.797, 16.457, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.738, 16.803, 17.403, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.738, 17.8, 18.307, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.738, 18.809, 19.399, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.738, 19.814, 20.386, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.738, 20.801, 21.319, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.738, 21.8, 22.428, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.738, 22.803, 23.381, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.738, 23.8, 24.406, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.738, 24.805, 25.298, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.738, 25.801, 26.327, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.738, 26.802, 27.284, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.738, 27.798, 28.332, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.738, 28.797, 29.309, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.738, 29.795, 30.357, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.738, 30.804, 31.283, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.738, 31.802, 32.421, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.737, 32.801, 33.349, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.737, 33.806, 34.373, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.737, 34.806, 35.321, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.737, 35.802, 36.351, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.737, 36.804, 37.291, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.737, 37.805, 38.386, 