{"id": "q0484", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1673745285, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "电动汽车是智能交通的未来。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0484.wav", "input_sha256": "5a4727dc7720144a37c2f5dfbdfb9b36addffb26fffba5f4ccbc7c2de898316f", "input_samples": 44400, "input_s": 2.775, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.5161, "act": 0.9942, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "电动汽车是智能交通的未来。它不仅减少了尾气排放，有助于改善空气质量，还通过与智能电网和自动驾驶技术的结合，提升了交通系统的整体效率。电动汽车通常配备高精度传感器和通信系统，能实现车辆之间的互联互动，从而优化路况、减少堵车并提高出行安全性。随着充电基础设施的不断完善，电动汽车将越来越普及，推动城市向更可持续、更智能的方向发展。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 37, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0484_local_local.wav", "sha256": "39fea1f2f0182e5e288ab0737b8c7c6ab4851cf8dbbf03d763fcc6aded3d1a99", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 36.96}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.054, 1.096, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.059, 2.102, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.775, 2.834, 2.88, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.775, 3.83, 4.139, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.775, 4.835, 5.332, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.775, 5.828, 6.345, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.775, 6.832, 7.298, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.775, 7.831, 8.365, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.775, 8.833, 9.28, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.775, 9.83, 10.31, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.775, 10.834, 11.321, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.775, 11.828, 12.304, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.775, 12.834, 13.315, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.775, 13.8