{"id": "q0495", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 232739410, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "创建一个程序将动物分类到不同的组中。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0495.wav", "input_sha256": "7b886e4768c29eb5cc29c2f6d4325794a5bbd188bb170da8d0c4e8eea3c8f8a4", "input_samples": 63400, "input_s": 3.962, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.2264, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "首先我们需要准备一个列表，列出所有动物的名称。然后根据它们的特征来进行分类。比如说哺乳动物、鸟类、爬行动物、两栖动物以及鱼类等。我们可以根据它们是不是有毛发或者是恒温动物来进行分类。接下来我们可以使用编程语言编写程序来实现这个功能。在程序中我们可以定义不同类型的动物并将它们放入不同的组别中。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 38, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_local_local.wav", "sha256": "ff283b08f751b5ee4163957fd3f8fbc79320f10b3d51f110cd38360c33d2cafc", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 36.48}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.054, 1.096, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.058, 2.104, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.055, 3.096, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.962, 4.021, 4.067, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.963, 5.018, 5.136, 0, 0, 0], [5, 0, 5.963, 6.021, 6.499, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.963, 7.021, 7.557, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.963, 8.022, 8.509, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.963, 9.021, 9.544, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.963, 10.023, 10.528, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.963, 11.02, 11.473, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.963, 12.024, 12.56, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.963, 13.023, 13.522, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.963, 14.025, 14.577, 0, 2400